# Purpose
Explains how teams time-box work in sprints and group it in projects.

# Sanitization
Written fresh from the engine contract and code (rewrite-only): no
version numbers, services or error codes; example repository names use
example-org.

# Gotchas
- Projects record no time (time entries are not built); keep that line true.
- Ceremony preparation is an AI task and does not start by itself.
- Code rule: 2-16 of A-Z, 0-9, hyphen, starting with a letter or digit;
  unique among active projects; restore needs the code to be free.
- Sprint and project agent tools need recent node versions; the update
  button is "Update to …" on the gv.system Settings card.

